{
  "_doc": [
    "Sprites: height is a fraction of screen height; frames animate at fps; spin = pre-rendered rotation steps;",
    "anim = folder of baked clips (tools/bake), directions = 4 rotated variants instead of a mirror.",
    "Elements: min/max = intensity range where it appears (1.0 = Halloween itself, the run-up is ~0.1..0.75);",
    "video_min = from which intensity it also shows over a playing video (default never).",
    "count/max_active/every scale with intensity. band = keep to the left/right screen edges (below prime).",
    "hz = redraw rate (default 15, particles 12). say = speech balloon (only when themes_text is on).",
    "Types: decor, particles, flyer, walker, dropper (spider on a thread), crawler (baked walker),",
    "performer (baked character scene), peeker (rises from an edge or from behind decor)."
